  "字幕文件": "Subtitle files",
  "字幕直接画进画面，任何播放器都能看到。需要重新编码视频，耗时较长；多种语言会叠在一起，所以只烧录选中的第一条文字字幕（弹幕可以同时烧录）。": "Subtitles are drawn into the picture and show in any player. The video must be re-encoded, which takes longer; several languages would overlap, so only the first selected text subtitle is burned in (danmaku can be burned in at the same time).",
