  "把 {0} 个文件移动到新的文件夹？同一个作品的字幕、封面会一起移动，目标已有同名文件的会跳过。": "Move {0} files to new folders? Subtitles and covers of the same work move together; files whose target already exists are skipped.",
  "把下载完成、失败、开播、订阅更新、登录失效推送到手机或聊天工具。令牌和 Webhook 地址加密保存在本机，不会写进设置文件，也不会进入备份。": "Push download complete, failure, going live, subscription updates and login expiry to your phone or chat apps. Tokens and webhook URLs are stored encrypted locally, never written to the settings file and never included in backups.",
