  "把所选 {0} 项加密放进保险箱？加密完成后，它们会从媒体库里消失，原文件和封面缓存会被覆盖删除。": "Encrypt the {0} selected items into the safe? After encryption they disappear from the library, and the originals and cover caches are overwritten and deleted.",
