  "把文件夹里已有的视频、音频、图片登记进媒体库，和视频同名的字幕会一起登记。已经在媒体库里的文件会跳过。": "Register the videos, audio and images already in a folder into the library; subtitles with the same name as a video are registered along with it. Files already in the library are skipped.",
