  "锁定后界面被遮住，托盘迷你窗和系统通知不显示内容。下载仍在后台继续，手机推送、命令行和网页控制台也照常工作。它挡的是坐在屏幕前的人，不会加密你的文件。": "When locked the interface is covered, and the tray mini window and system notifications show no content. Downloads continue in the background, and phone push, the command line and the web console keep working. It keeps out whoever sits at the screen; it does not encrypt your files.",
