  "使用 vidstab 两遍防抖：先分析抖动，再平滑并适当放大裁掉边缘，效果好，耗时约为视频长度的 1–2 倍。": "Uses two-pass vidstab: it analyzes the shake first, then smooths it and zooms in slightly to crop the edges. Works well and takes about 1–2 times the video length.",
  "修正音画不同步": "Fix audio/video sync",
  "先测量整段音频再调整（两遍），保持原有的动态，不会忽大忽小。": "Measures the whole audio first and then adjusts it (two passes), keeping the original dynamics so the volume does not pump.",
