  "稳定手持拍摄的抖动画面，会略微放大裁掉边缘。声音不动。": "Steadies shaky handheld footage; the picture is zoomed in slightly and the edges are cropped. The sound is untouched.",
  "立体声": "Stereo",
  "精简版": "lite edition",
  "精简版（LGPL）没有 x264 / x265 编码器和 vidstab 防抖，只能用硬件编码、openh264 或 VP9 输出视频。 完整版（GPL）带 x264、x265、vidstab 防抖、zscale 色调映射等，画质和效果更好；它按 GPL 授权，由你自己下载使用，不随清影分发。选好后点下面的按钮即可切换。": "The lite edition (LGPL) has no x264 / x265 encoders or vidstab stabilization, so video can only be written with hardware encoding, openh264 or VP9. The full edition (GPL) includes x264, x265, vidstab, zscale tone mapping and more, giving better quality and results; it is GPL-licensed, downloaded by you and not distributed with ClearClip. After choosing, press the button below to switch.",
