  "通用兼容": "General compatibility",
  "任何设备和软件都能播放：H.264 / 8 位 / BT.709，HDR 转成 SDR，可变帧率转固定帧率，超过 1080p 的缩小到 1080p。": "Plays on any device and software: H.264 / 8-bit / BT.709, HDR to SDR, variable to constant frame rate, anything above 1080p shrunk to 1080p.",
  "剪辑素材统一": "Unify editing footage",
  "导入剪辑软件前统一规格：1920×1080（竖屏 1080×1920）、固定 30 帧、48 kHz 立体声、响度 -16 LUFS，去黑边。": "Unify the spec before importing into an editor: 1920×1080 (portrait 1080×1920), constant 30 fps, 48 kHz stereo, -16 LUFS loudness, black bars removed.",
  "手机录屏": "Phone screen recording",
  "录屏常见问题：可变帧率（剪辑软件里音画不同步）、横竖屏切换留下的黑边、旋转标记。转成固定帧率，去黑边，音频统一为 48 kHz 立体声。": "Typical screen-recording problems: variable frame rate (A/V drift in editors), black bars left by orientation changes, rotation tags. Converts to constant frame rate, removes black bars and unifies audio to 48 kHz stereo.",
  "FLV / TS 录制文件：修正时间戳跳变和音画不同步，转成 MP4，响度统一到 -16 LUFS。视频本身没问题时不重新编码。": "FLV / TS recordings: fixes timestamp jumps and A/V drift, converts to MP4 and unifies loudness to -16 LUFS. No re-encoding when the video itself is fine.",
