  "几段来源不同的画面拼在一起、各段偏色、亮度或饱和度不一致时：把和整体不一致的镜头单独校正到和整体一致，一致的镜头不动；同时去黑边、补全色彩信息。": "For footage stitched together from different sources whose colour cast, brightness or saturation differ: shots that don't match the rest are corrected individually to match the whole, consistent shots are left alone; also removes black bars and fills in colour info.",
