  "下载来的成片：HDR 转 SDR、去黑边、补全色彩信息；其余保持原样，没有需要改的就不重新编码。": "Downloaded finished videos: HDR to SDR, black bars removed, color information completed; everything else is kept, and nothing is re-encoded when nothing needs changing.",
  "竖屏短视频 1080×1920": "Portrait short video 1080×1920",
  "抖音 / 快手 / 小红书 / 视频号：统一成 1080×1920（比例不符的用模糊背景补边）、30 帧、48 kHz 立体声、响度 -14 LUFS。": "Douyin / Kuaishou / Xiaohongshu / Channels: unified to 1080×1920 (blurred background for other aspect ratios), 30 fps, 48 kHz stereo, -14 LUFS loudness.",
  "横屏 1080p": "Landscape 1080p",
  "B站 / YouTube：统一成 1920×1080（比例不符的用模糊背景补边）、固定帧率、48 kHz 立体声、响度 -14 LUFS。": "Bilibili / YouTube: unified to 1920×1080 (blurred background for other aspect ratios), constant frame rate, 48 kHz stereo, -14 LUFS loudness.",
  "省空间（HEVC）": "Save space (HEVC)",
  "重新编码成 HEVC，同样画质体积通常小三成以上，适合长期存放。需要 ffmpeg 有 HEVC 编码器（完整版或硬件编码）。": "Re-encodes to HEVC; the same quality is usually over 30% smaller, good for long-term storage. Needs an ffmpeg with an HEVC encoder (full edition or hardware encoding).",
  "可变帧率": "Variable frame rate",
  "有黑边": "Black bars",
  "非方形像素": "Non-square pixels",
  "全范围色彩": "Full-range color",
  "缺少色彩信息": "Missing color information",
  "文件没有写明色彩空间，播放器只能猜测，可能偏色。": "The file does not state its color space, so players can only guess and colors may be off.",
  "色彩范围是 0–255（JPEG 范围），多数视频软件按 16–235 处理，会造成对比度偏差。": "The color range is 0–255 (JPEG range); most video software treats it as 16–235, causing contrast errors.",
  "较新的编码，部分旧设备和剪辑软件无法播放或很卡，需要兼容时可转成 H.264。": "A newer codec that some older devices and editors cannot play or play slowly; convert to H.264 when compatibility is needed.",
  "高帧率素材体积大、很多设备播放吃力。": "High-frame-rate footage is large and many devices struggle to play it.",
  "部分设备和软件无法播放 10 位视频，可转成 8 位。": "Some devices and software cannot play 10-bit video; it can be converted to 8-bit.",
  "不是常见的 44.1 / 48 kHz，部分软件会重采样或报错。": "Not the common 44.1 / 48 kHz; some software resamples or reports errors.",
  "多声道在手机和耳机上会被混音，音量可能偏小。": "Multichannel audio is downmixed on phones and headphones, so the volume may be low.",
  "靠播放器读取旋转标记才能正确显示，处理后会把画面真正转正。": "Displays correctly only if the player reads the rotation tag; processing turns the picture upright for real.",
  "-100 是黑白，+100 约两倍": "-100 is black and white, +100 is about double",
