  "保存为 .cube…": "Save as .cube…",
  "先套用这些 LUT，再在它们的基础上调整。按列表顺序叠加，可以分别调强度。只支持 3D 的 .cube 文件。": "These LUTs are applied first and the adjustments below build on top of them. They stack in list order and each has its own strength. Only 3D .cube files are supported.",
