  "强度": "Strength",
  "往右把更多暗部压成纯黑；往左抬高黑位，有褪色胶片的感觉": "Right crushes more shadows to pure black; left lifts the black point for a faded-film feel",
  "往左偏绿，往右偏品红": "Left shifts toward green, right toward magenta",
  "往左偏蓝（冷），往右偏黄（暖）": "Left shifts toward blue (cool), right toward yellow (warm)",
  "往左把更多亮部推成纯白；往右压低最亮处": "Left pushes more highlights to pure white; right pulls the brightest areas down",
  "我的调色": "My grade",
  "把上面所有调整和原画面混合，100 是完全使用调整后的效果": "Blends all the adjustments above with the original picture; 100 uses the adjusted look fully",
  "拉开或收拢明暗差距，中灰不动": "Widens or narrows the gap between light and dark; middle gray stays put",
  "效果强度": "Overall strength",
  "整体": "Overall",
  "整体变亮或变暗，每档亮一倍（在线性光里调，不会发灰）": "Brightens or darkens everything, each stop doubles the light (done in linear light, so it does not turn gray)",
  "整体转动色轮，一般只用来做特殊效果": "Rotates the whole color wheel; usually only for special effects",
  "明暗匹配": "Tone match",
  "暗部强度": "Shadow amount",
  "暗部颜色": "Shadow color",
  "曝光": "Exposure",
  "正数提亮暗部、保留细节": "Positive values brighten shadows while keeping detail",
  "添加 LUT…": "Add LUT…",
  "生成的 LUT 面向普通的 Rec.709 / sRGB 画面，也就是手机、相机直出和平台下载的常见视频与图片。S-Log、V-Log、C-Log 之类的 Log 素材和 HDR 素材，需要先转换色彩空间再用，直接套用效果不对。": "The generated LUT is meant for ordinary Rec.709 / sRGB pictures, like phone and camera footage straight out of the device and videos and images downloaded from platforms. Log footage (S-Log, V-Log, C-Log and the like) and HDR footage must have its color space converted first; applying the LUT directly gives wrong results.",
  "用一张示例图片（或视频里的一帧）边看边调，调好后生成 .cube 文件，可以用在视频规整里，也可以导入剪映、DaVinci Resolve、Premiere、OBS 等支持 3D LUT 的软件。可以在别人的 LUT 上继续调整，也可以让示例图片的色调向一张参考图靠拢。": "Adjust while looking at a sample image (or a frame from a video), then generate a .cube file. Use it in video normalize, or import it into software that supports 3D LUTs such as CapCut, DaVinci Resolve, Premiere and OBS. You can keep adjusting on top of someone else's LUT, or pull the sample's look toward a reference image.",
  "用于视频规整": "Use in video normalize",
  "白场": "White point",
  "示例图片或视频": "sample image or video",
  "取视频里这个时间点的画面": "Take the frame at this time",
  "黑场": "Black point",
  "精细度": "Precision",
  "给暗部和亮部各染一种颜色，常见的“青橙”电影感就是暗部偏青、亮部偏橙。只改颜色，不改明暗。": "Tint the shadows and the highlights with a color each; the common teal-and-orange cinema look is teal shadows and orange highlights. Only color changes, not brightness.",
  "自然饱和度": "Vibrance",
  "色彩匹配": "Color match",
  "色温": "Temperature",
  "色相偏移": "Hue shift",
  "色调": "Tint",
  "让亮部、暗部的分布向参考图靠拢": "Pulls the distribution of lights and darks toward the reference",
  "让整体偏色和饱和度向参考图靠拢": "Pulls the overall color cast and saturation toward the reference",
  "读取到的图片数据不对。": "The image data received is invalid.",
  "调整": "Adjust",
  "调整后": "Adjusted",
  "负数压低亮部、找回细节": "Negative values pull highlights down and recover detail",
  "还没有示例图片，匹配需要先选一张。": "There is no sample image yet; matching needs one.",
  "选一张色调想要的图片，程序会算出怎样调整示例图片，让它的明暗分布和整体色彩更接近参考图，再把这个调整生成到 LUT 里。需要先选好上面的示例图片；匹配出来的是整体的色调倾向，不会把参考图的内容搬过来。": "Pick an image whose look you want. The app works out how to adjust the sample so its tonal distribution and overall color get closer to the reference, then bakes that adjustment into the LUT. A sample image must be chosen above first; what is matched is the overall tonal tendency, none of the reference's content is carried over.",
  "重置": "Reset",
  "阴影": "Shadows",
  "预览数据不对。": "The preview data is invalid.",
  "饱和度": "Saturation",
  "高光": "Highlights",
