  "鲜艳通透": "Vivid and clear",
  "清新明亮": "Fresh and bright",
  "黑白高反差": "High-contrast B&W",
  "偏黄偏暖，对比度略增": "Yellower and warmer, slightly more contrast",
  "偏蓝偏冷，对比度略增": "Bluer and cooler, slightly more contrast",
  "暗部偏青、亮部偏橙，对比度加强": "Teal shadows, orange highlights, stronger contrast",
  "抬高黑位、压低饱和度，暗部偏青、亮部偏黄": "Lifted blacks, lower saturation, teal shadows and yellow highlights",
  "提亮暗部、加强对比和自然饱和度": "Brighter shadows, more contrast and vibrance",
  "提亮、降低对比，偏冷一点": "Brighter, lower contrast, a little cooler",
  "去掉颜色，加强对比": "Remove color, boost contrast",
  "-100% 变成黑白，+100% 颜色浓一倍": "-100% turns it black and white, +100% doubles the colour strength",
  "0 = 这个镜头不做自动校正": "0 = no automatic correction for this shot",
  "0 为关闭。视频里有几段来源不同、偏色（偏黄、偏蓝……）、亮度或饱和度和整体不一致时，把不一致的镜头自动校正到和整体一致，一致的镜头不动。这个滑块是统一的自动校正强度。": "0 turns it off. When some parts of the video come from different sources and have a colour cast (yellowish, bluish…) or different brightness or saturation, the inconsistent shots are corrected automatically to match the rest; consistent shots are left alone. This slider is the overall automatic correction strength.",
  "16–235 是视频的标准电平（电视范围），游戏、影视美术、投稿平台等基本都要求用它，所以是默认值；0–255 是全范围，黑和白更满，但有些播放器和剪辑软件对全范围视频的处理不一致，除非明确要求，不建议用。": "16–235 is the standard video level (TV range). Games, film art and upload platforms generally require it, so it is the default. 0–255 is full range with fuller blacks and whites, but some players and editors handle full-range video inconsistently, so avoid it unless it is explicitly required.",
  "中": "Medium",
  "弱": "Light",
  "强": "Strong",
  "高质量": "High quality",
  "亮度": "Brightness",
  "全部归零": "Reset all",
  "共 {0} 个镜头，{1} 个和整体不一致（橙色）。{2} 个单独调节。": "{0} shots, {1} differ from the rest (orange). {2} adjusted individually.",
  "去掉轻微的噪点：白天拍摄的素材、轻度压缩产生的颗粒。": "Removes slight noise: daylight footage and grain from light compression.",
  "噪点很重时用。画面会更柔和，毛发、纹理这些细节可能被抹掉一些。": "For heavy noise. The picture gets softer, and fine detail such as hair and texture may be smoothed away.",
  "夜景、室内暗光、高 ISO 的素材常用这一档。": "The usual choice for night scenes, dim interiors and high-ISO footage.",
  "往偏绿 / 往偏品红": "Towards green / towards magenta",
  "往冷（偏蓝）/ 往暖（偏黄）": "Towards cool (blue) / towards warm (yellow)",
  "按镜头单独调节": "Adjust shots individually",
  "单独调节": "Adjust individually",
  "整体变暗 / 变亮": "Darker / brighter overall",
  "明暗反差变小 / 变大": "Less / more contrast",
  "没有单独调节的镜头都用这组参数，包括检测不出差异的镜头；全 0 就是不额外调节。": "Every shot that is not adjusted individually uses these values, including shots where no difference was detected. All zeros means no extra adjustment.",
  "沿用素材": "Keep the source's",
  "统一调节": "Overall adjustment",
  "自动校正": "Auto correction",
  "补写缺失的色彩标记；高清素材的 BT.601 转 BT.709。": "Writes missing color tags; converts BT.601 to BT.709 for HD footage.",
  "解码一遍关键帧，几秒到几十秒。检测出和整体不一致的镜头后，可以选其中的某几个单独调节，没选的镜头用上面的统一参数。": "Decodes the keyframes once, which takes a few seconds to a few tens of seconds. After inconsistent shots are found, pick any of them to adjust individually; the others use the overall values above.",
  "输出电平": "Output level",
  "降噪": "Noise reduction",
  "非局部均值算法，画质最好，但处理速度只有其他档位的四分之一左右，适合需要认真处理的短素材。": "Non-local means: the best quality, but only about a quarter of the speed of the other levels. Good for short clips that deserve the effort.",
  "高质量（最慢）": "High quality (slowest)",
  "降噪（{0}，fftdnoiz，强度 {1}）": "Noise reduction ({0}, fftdnoiz, strength {1})",
  "降噪（{0}，nlmeans 非局部均值，处理速度慢）": "Noise reduction ({0}, nlmeans non-local means, slow)",
  "降噪（{0}，hqdn3d）": "Noise reduction ({0}, hqdn3d)",
  "降噪（{0}，atadenoise 时域平均）": "Noise reduction ({0}, atadenoise temporal averaging)",
  "当前的 ffmpeg 没有降噪滤镜（fftdnoiz、nlmeans、hqdn3d、atadenoise），降噪没有执行。": "This ffmpeg has no noise-reduction filter (fftdnoiz, nlmeans, hqdn3d, atadenoise), so noise reduction was not applied.",
  "当前的 ffmpeg 没有所选档位首选的降噪滤镜，改用了效果稍弱的替代做法。": "This ffmpeg lacks the preferred noise-reduction filter for the chosen level, so a slightly weaker alternative was used.",
  "全范围色彩转电视范围（16–235）": "Full-range color converted to TV range (16–235)",
  "电视范围转全范围（0–255）": "TV range expanded to full range (0–255)",
  "分段色彩匹配：{0} 个不一致的镜头自动校正到和整体一致": "Per-shot colour matching: {0} inconsistent shots corrected automatically to match the rest",
  "分段色彩匹配：{0} 个镜头单独调节": "Per-shot colour matching: {0} shots adjusted individually",
  "分段色彩匹配：统一的手动调节": "Per-shot colour matching: overall manual adjustment",
  "分段色彩匹配：{0} 个不一致的镜头自动校正到和整体一致，统一的手动调节": "Per-shot colour matching: {0} inconsistent shots corrected automatically to match the rest, plus the overall manual adjustment",
  "分段色彩匹配：{0} 个镜头单独调节，其余镜头用统一的手动调节": "Per-shot colour matching: {0} shots adjusted individually, the rest use the overall manual adjustment",
  "分段色彩匹配：{0} 个不一致的镜头自动校正到和整体一致，{1} 个镜头单独调节": "Per-shot colour matching: {0} inconsistent shots corrected automatically to match the rest, {1} shots adjusted individually",
  "分段色彩匹配：{0} 个不一致的镜头自动校正到和整体一致，{1} 个镜头单独调节，其余镜头用统一的手动调节": "Per-shot colour matching: {0} inconsistent shots corrected automatically to match the rest, {1} shots adjusted individually, the rest use the overall manual adjustment",
  "排除的时间段": "Excluded time ranges",
  "这些时间不参与匹配：不计入“整体”的基准，也不会被校正，保持原样。适合片头片尾的 Logo、黑场、故意调过色的段落。可以填时间（如 0:03 – 0:06），也可以填帧号（第几帧到第几帧，从 1 开始、含首尾两帧）；结束留空 = 一直到结尾。": "These times are left out of the matching: they do not count towards the overall look and are never corrected, so they stay exactly as they are. Useful for logos at the start or end, black frames, or sections that were graded on purpose. Enter times (for example 0:03 – 0:06) or frame numbers (from frame N to frame M, counting from 1, both ends included). Leave the end empty to go to the end of the video.",
