  "一个片段只有一个“跟随聚焦”，它改变整个镜头的取景，不受“生效时间”限制。监视器里橙色虚线框是取景窗口的示意位置（没有算镜头平滑）。": "A clip can have only one “Follow focus”. It changes the framing of the whole shot and is not limited by “Active time”. The orange dashed box in the monitor shows roughly where the framing window is (camera smoothing is not applied).",
