  "作用于区域以外（保留区域里的，处理其余部分）": "Apply outside the region (keep the inside, process the rest)",
  "先把播放位置停在物体清楚可见的那一帧，再加区域：可以点“感知”出来的物体，也可以自己拖出一个框。然后点“开始追踪”，它就会在整个片段里跟着物体走。": "Park the playhead on a frame where the object is clearly visible, then add a region: click a detected object or drag out a box yourself. Then click “Start tracking” and the region follows the object through the whole clip.",
