  "检测静音": "Detect silence",
  "显示波形": "Show waveform",
  "没有检测到静音。可以把阈值调高（更容易算静音）或把最短时长调短。": "No silence found. Raise the level (easier to count as silence) or shorten the minimum length.",
  "没有可去掉的静音（静音段比要留的停顿还短，或者整段都是静音）。": "Nothing to remove (silences are shorter than the pause to keep, or the whole clip is silent).",
  "双击一段可以跳到那个位置听一下。去掉静音后，这个片段之后的叠加素材、文字、配乐会一起前移；片段中间的不会动。": "Double-click a span to jump there. After removing silence, overlays, text and music after this clip move earlier together; those in the middle of the clip stay put.",
  "这个片段没有声音（或已静音）。": "This clip has no sound (or is muted).",
  "降噪 / 人声增强": "Denoise / voice enhancement",
  "切掉低频隆隆声、提一点清晰度、轻度压缩让音量更均匀": "Cuts low rumble, adds a little clarity and light compression for an even level",
  "请先打开降噪或人声增强。": "Turn on denoise or voice enhancement first.",
  "实时预览听不到处理效果，请用“试听 15 秒”；导出时才会真正处理。底噪是稳定的嘶嘶声时效果最好。": "The live preview doesn't play the processed sound; use \"Audition 15 s\". It is only applied on export. Works best on steady hiss.",
