  "1:1 方形": "1:1 square",
  "4:5 竖版": "4:5 portrait",
  "16:9 横屏": "16:9 landscape",
  "越大越稳、跟得越慢": "Higher is steadier but follows slower",
  "对时间线上所有视频片段分别处理（先用“场景分割”切成镜头效果更好）": "Process every video clip on the timeline separately (works better after \"Scene split\")",
  "自动取景": "Auto reframe",
  "没有找到明显的运动物体，已居中取景。": "No clear moving subject found; framed the centre.",
  "已生成取景区域，可以在“区域”页微调。": "Framing region created; fine-tune it on the Regions tab.",
  "请先选中一个视频片段。": "Select a video clip first.",
  "已取消。": "Canceled.",
  "这个片段已经有取景区域，重新取景会替换它。": "This clip already has a framing region; reframing replaces it.",
  "没有感知到明显在动的物体，已居中取景。可以在“区域”页手动框选要跟着走的物体。": "No clearly moving subject was found; framed the centre. You can box the subject on the Regions tab.",
  "{0} · {1}。分析只给出候选结果，确认后才会修改时间线，可以撤销。": "{0} · {1}. Analysis only suggests candidates; the timeline changes after you confirm, and it can be undone.",
  "会把成片画面尺寸改成所选比例，找到画面里最显眼的运动物体并整段追踪，生成一个“聚焦”区域（可以在“区域”页微调或手动校正）。只认运动物体，不认人脸；静止的画面会居中取景。{0}": "Sets the output size to the chosen ratio, finds the most prominent moving subject, tracks it through the clip and creates a \"focus\" region (fine-tune or correct it on the Regions tab). It recognizes motion, not faces; still shots are framed in the centre. {0}",
  "去掉 {0} 段静音（共 {1}）": "Remove {0} silent spans ({1} in total)",
  "声音波形": "Audio waveform",
