  "{0}。生成文稿后，在文稿里选词删除就能剪视频；也可以直接按词生成字幕。": "{0}. After generating the transcript, select words and delete them to cut the video; you can also generate captions from the words directly.",
  "不高亮": "No highlight",
  "中文每个字是一个词，“那个”就是相邻的两个词。词表是你自己的，“就是”“然后”这类词有时是正常表达，剪之前检查一遍。": "In Chinese each character is a word, so a two-character filler is two adjacent words. The list is yours — words like “就是” are sometimes normal speech, so check before cutting.",
  "先清掉这个片段范围内已有的文字": "Clear existing text within this clip first",
  "出现和消失时渐变；导出时只作用在字上，描边和底色块不跟着变": "Fade in and out; on export it only affects the letters, not the outline or background box",
  "剪掉选中的词（{0} 个，{1}）": "Cut selected words ({0}, {1})",
  "半透明黑色底条，复杂背景上也看得清": "Semi-transparent black bar; readable on busy backgrounds",
  "卡拉 OK": "Karaoke",
  "取消选择": "Clear selection",
  "口头禅": "Filler words",
  "嗯,呃,啊,额,那个,就是,然后呢,um,uh,er,erm,you know": "um,uh,er,erm,you know,like,嗯,呃,啊,额,那个,就是,然后呢",
  "大号黄字": "Big yellow",
  "字幕就是普通的文字条，生成后可以在“文字”页改字、改样式、挪位置。逐字高亮和淡入淡出的字幕需要 ffmpeg 带 ass 滤镜，导出时才能看到完整效果；实时预览里是近似的。改过字的字幕会按普通文字显示。": "Captions are ordinary text items; after generating them you can edit the text, style and position on the Text page. Per-word highlight needs an ffmpeg with the ass filter and shows fully on export; the live preview is approximate. Captions whose text you edit are drawn as plain text.",
  "已剪掉 {0}，后面的内容已前移。": "Cut {0}; later content moved earlier.",
  "已生成 {0} 条字幕，可以在“文字”页逐条调整。": "Generated {0} captions; adjust them one by one on the Text page.",
  "底条": "Bar",
  "找出口头禅": "Find fillers",
  "找到 {0} 个词。检查一下，不想剪的按住 Ctrl（Mac 用 ⌘）点一下取消，然后点“剪掉选中的词”。": "Found {0} words. Check them; hold Ctrl (⌘ on Mac) and click to deselect any you want to keep, then press “Cut selected words”.",
