  "没有找到口头禅。": "No filler words found.",
  "点一个词跳到那里；Shift + 点选一段，Ctrl / ⌘ + 点增减单个词；“选句”一次选一整句。选好后点“剪掉选中的词”。": "Click a word to jump there; Shift+click selects a range, Ctrl / ⌘+click toggles single words; “Pick” selects a whole sentence. Then press “Cut selected words”.",
