  "这次识别只给了整句的时间，词的位置是按字数估计的，剪出来的边界可能不准。想要准确的词级时间，请用 whisper.cpp 或支持词级时间戳的接口。": "This recognition only returned sentence timings; word positions are estimated from character counts, so cut boundaries may be off. For accurate word timing use whisper.cpp or an API that supports word timestamps.",
