  "只在导入了别的模型时才需要改。内置的 Kim Vocal 2 是 7680，很多 MDX-Net 模型是 6144。留空用默认值": "Only change this if you imported a different model. The built-in Kim Vocal 2 uses 7680; many MDX-Net models use 6144. Leave empty for the default",
