  "用 MDX-Net 的 ONNX 模型在本机 CPU 上算，不上传。三分钟的歌大约要几分钟；一次最多处理 20 分钟。结果是 44.1 kHz 立体声 WAV，存在应用数据目录的 vocals 文件夹里。": "Runs an MDX-Net ONNX model on this computer's CPU; nothing is uploaded. A 3-minute song takes a few minutes; at most 20 minutes per run. The result is 44.1 kHz stereo WAV, saved in the vocals folder of the app data directory.",
