  "主流流媒体平台会把过响的内容压低，做到这个值就不会被再调一遍。": "Major streaming platforms turn down content that is too loud; matching this value avoids being adjusted again.",
  "以说话为主：响度范围收窄，轻声和大声之间差得少，戴耳机听也舒服。": "For speech: a narrower loudness range, so quiet and loud parts differ less and it is comfortable on headphones.",
