  "按下后整屏冻结，框选要翻译的区域，用视觉模型识字翻译并盖回原位。需要在“AI”里选一个能看图的模型；留空表示不使用。": "After you press it the screen freezes; select the area to translate, and a vision model reads and translates the text and puts it back in place. You need to pick a vision-capable model under “AI”; leave empty to disable.",
