  "时段外限速": "Speed limit outside the windows",
  "桌面上的清影小窗口：把浏览器里的链接拖进去就开始下载，也可以点一下后按 Ctrl+V 粘贴；双击回到主窗口。在“屏幕翻译”里开了“悬浮窗里放屏幕翻译控制”的话，这个窗里还有屏幕翻译的开关（不管这里开没开都会显示）": "A small ClearClip window on the desktop: drag a link from your browser onto it to start downloading, or click it and press Ctrl+V to paste; double-click to return to the main window. If you turned on “Show screen translation controls in the floating window” under “Screen translation”, this window also has the screen translation switch (shown regardless of this setting)",
  "清影平台体检 {0} {1}": "ClearClip platform health check {0} {1}",
  "用批次名当文件夹名": "Use the batch name as the folder name",
  "用示例链接（最近一次成功解析的链接，或内置示例）测试各平台解析是否正常，用于判断是网站改版还是网络问题。列表页（播放列表、创作者主页、合集）用你最近解析成功过的链接测，并且会展开其中一个列表试一次；没解析过的就显示“没有示例链接”。每升级一个版本后跑一次，有异常就复制结果发给开发者。": "Tests parsing on each platform with sample links (the most recent successfully parsed link, or a built-in sample) to tell whether a site changed or the network is at fault. List pages (playlists, creator pages, collections) are tested with the link you most recently parsed successfully, and one of the lists is expanded once; if you have never parsed one it shows “No sample link”. Run it once after each upgrade, and copy the result to the developer if anything looks wrong.",
  "翻译后自动复制译文": "Copy the translation automatically after translating",
  "记录最近的截图翻译": "Remember recent screenshot translations",
  "设置分类": "Settings categories",
  "诊断信息包含版本、系统、网页组件和 yt-dlp / ffmpeg 的版本、设置概要、失败任务和最近日志（连续重复的行合成一行）。“复制摘要”只带警告和错误，短得多。Cookie、令牌等敏感内容会自动隐去。": "Diagnostics include the version, system, web component, yt-dlp / ffmpeg versions, a settings overview, failed tasks and recent logs (consecutive duplicate lines are merged). “Copy summary” only includes warnings and errors and is much shorter. Cookies, tokens and other sensitive content are masked automatically.",
