  "可以放多个服务：每次请求按“适用任务 → 优先级（数字小的先用）→ 今天用得少的先用”自动挑一个；某个服务额度用完、被限流或出错时自动冷却并换下一个，不用你手动切换。免费额度用完的服务会在次日零点（北京时间）自动恢复。密钥加密保存在本机，不进设置文件和备份。": "You can add several services: for every request one is picked automatically by “applicable task → priority (lower number first) → the one used less today first”. When a service runs out of quota, is rate-limited or errors, it cools down and the next one takes over, with no manual switching. Services whose free quota is used up recover automatically at midnight (Beijing time) the next day. Keys are stored encrypted on this computer and are not kept in the settings file or backups.",
