  "译文缓存已清": "Translation cache cleared",
  "译文贴字层不会出现在系统截图或别的截图软件里（否则会被自己再识别一遍）。想留下带译文的图，用“保存译图”：它会取一帧干净的画面，把译文按现在的排版叠上去，存到“下载文件夹/屏幕翻译截图”，同时复制到剪贴板。": "The translation overlay doesn't appear in system screenshots or other screenshot tools (otherwise it would be recognized again by itself). To keep an image with the translation, use “Save translated image”: it takes a clean frame, overlays the translation in the current layout, saves it to “Downloads/Screen translation screenshots” and copies it to the clipboard.",
  "试识别一次": "Try recognizing once",
  "语言包已装好": "Language pack installed",
  "语言包是对应语言的 PaddleOCR 识别模型（ONNX）加字典，可以从 RapidOCR 的模型库里找；要先装好上面的增强识字组件（检测模型沿用它）。识字语言选“日语”等之后会自动用对应的包。": "A language pack is a PaddleOCR recognition model (ONNX) for that language plus a dictionary, which you can find in RapidOCR's model library; install the Enhanced OCR component above first (it reuses its detection model). After you pick a language such as “Japanese” as the OCR language, the matching pack is used automatically.",
  "语音翻译.{0}": "Voice translation.{0}",
  "越快越灵敏，也越费资源。": "Faster is more responsive but uses more resources.",
  "跟随窗口": "Follow window",
  "跨屏合并": "Merge across screens",
  "边听边把字幕写进一个 .srt 文件（每次“开始听”新建一个），停下来、关机、崩溃都不会丢。保存时同样做“设置 → AI”里的字幕预处理（去非语音说明和口水词），清理前的原文另存为 .srt.raw": "While listening, subtitles are written to an .srt file (a new one each time you press “Start listening”), so nothing is lost when you stop, shut down or crash. When saving, the same subtitle preprocessing as “Settings → AI” is applied (removes non-speech notes and filler words); the original before cleanup is saved as .srt.raw",
  "运行中": "Running",
  "运行中 · {0}": "Running · {0}",
  "还没有记住任何程序。": "No programs remembered yet.",
  "这些已经装过了": "These are already installed",
  "选了云端识字，截下来的画面会发给这家服务。密钥只存在本机设置里。": "With cloud OCR selected, captured images are sent to that service. The key is stored only in the settings on this computer.",
  "选择字典（.txt）": "Choose dictionary (.txt)",
