  "VAD 模型（可选，ggml-silero-*.bin）": "VAD model (optional, ggml-silero-*.bin)",
  "[Music]、♪、(laughs)、>> 换人标记、说话人前缀。只影响送给模型的文字（摘要、导图、翻译等），文稿的显示和导出不变": "[Music], ♪, (laughs), >> speaker-change marks and speaker prefixes. Only affects the text sent to the model (summaries, mind maps, translation, etc.); the transcript display and exports are unchanged",
  "{0} 高级": "{0} Advanced",
