  "例如 595f23df": "e.g. 595f23df",
  "保守": "Conservative",
  "保守（推荐）": "Conservative (recommended)",
  "保守：嗯、呃、um、uh、结巴和叠词；标准：再加成串的口头禅（you know、那个那个）；激进：再加被逗号隔开的单个口头禅（like、就是）。只影响送给模型的文字，文稿的显示和导出不变": "Conservative: um, uh, stuttering and repeated words; Standard: also strings of verbal tics (you know, 那个那个); Aggressive: also single tics separated by commas (like, 就是). Only affects the text sent to the model; the transcript display and exports are unchanged",
  "全程不联网。模型和“设置 → 组件 → 语音识别”是同一个选择，在哪边改都一样。中文建议用 SenseVoice（快、准）；Whisper 适合多语种和要逐词时间的场景。": "Fully offline. The model is the same choice as “Settings → Components → Speech recognition”; changing it in either place is the same. For Chinese, SenseVoice is recommended (fast, accurate); Whisper suits multiple languages and word-level timestamps.",
  "力度": "Strength",
  "双语": "Bilingual",
  "只用规则": "Rules only",
  "填了且 whisper-cli 支持时，只识别有人声的部分，减少静音处的胡乱识别": "When filled in and supported by whisper-cli, only the parts with a human voice are recognized, reducing garbage recognition in silence",
  "字幕句长（SenseVoice 一段声音一条字幕，太长时按标点和长度拆开）": "Subtitle length (SenseVoice makes one subtitle per stretch of sound; when it's too long it is split by punctuation and length)",
  "实时语音转写的 APIKey": "APIKey for real-time speech transcription",
  "实时转写 APIKey（“屏幕翻译 → 语音翻译”用讯飞时需要，和上面的 SecretKey 不是同一个）": "APIKey for real-time transcription (needed when “Screen translation → Voice translation” uses iFlytek; it is not the same as the SecretKey above)",
  "密钥（Access Token / API Key）": "Key (access token / API key)",
  "对话": "Chat",
  "已清除": "Cleared",
  "录音文件转写的 SecretKey": "SecretKey for audio file transcription",
  "打开火山引擎控制台": "Open the Volcano Engine console",
  "打开讯飞控制台": "Open the iFlytek console",
  "接口细节还没有用真实密钥验证过": "The API details haven't been verified with a real key yet",
  "摘要": "Summary",
  "断句": "Sentence splitting",
  "旧版控制台的 AppId，没有就留空": "AppId of the old console; leave empty if you don't have one",
  "本机 / 在线 / 火山引擎 / 讯飞识别出来的字幕，同样去掉非语音说明和口水词再保存；清理前的原文另存为 .raw.srt": "Subtitles recognized by on-device / online / Volcano Engine / iFlytek also have non-speech notes and filler words removed before saving; the original before cleanup is saved as .raw.srt",
  "本机识别（离线）": "On-device recognition (offline)",
  "查找": "Find",
  "标准（推荐）": "Standard (recommended)",
  "标记 {0}": "Mark {0}",
  "测试实时转写连接": "Test the real-time transcription connection",
  "激进": "Aggressive",
  "火山引擎（豆包）": "Volcano Engine (Doubao)",
  "用火山自带的“语义顺滑”去口水词": "Use Volcano's built-in “semantic smoothing” to remove filler words",
  "用讯飞的“顺滑词”标记去口水词": "Use iFlytek's “smoothing words” marks to remove filler words",
  "留空则自动使用“设置 → 组件”里下载的模型": "Leave empty to use the model downloaded under “Settings → Components” automatically",
  "留空则自动查找（清影安装的、系统 PATH 里的 whisper-cli）": "Leave empty to search automatically (the one installed by ClearClip, or whisper-cli on the system PATH)",
  "短（视频字幕层）": "Short (video subtitle layer)",
  "短：中文 16 字 / 英文 36 字符以内；标准：22 / 48；长：32 / 72。已经转写好的视频不会自动改，在视频摘要的文稿页点“重新断句”即可。": "Short: up to 16 Chinese characters / 36 English characters; Standard: 22 / 48; Long: 32 / 72. Videos already transcribed aren't changed automatically; click “Re-split sentences” on the video summary's transcript page.",
  "硅基流动": "SiliconFlow",
  "确认": "Confirm",
  "积极": "Active",
  "给没有字幕的视频生成字幕": "Generate subtitles for videos without subtitles",
  "自动检测到：": "Detected automatically:",
  "自动识别出来的字幕通常没有标点：读到文稿、做完上面的清理后，如果大部分句子没有标点，就自动用 AI 补标点并改同音错字（多一次模型调用，结果缓存）。可以在文稿栏点“还原顺句前”撤销": "Automatically recognized subtitles usually have no punctuation: after the transcript is read and the cleanup above is done, if most sentences have no punctuation, AI adds punctuation and fixes homophone errors automatically (one extra model call, result cached). You can undo it with “Restore pre-split text” in the transcript bar",
  "自动转写的字幕几乎没有标点时，自动 AI 纠错": "Auto AI correction when auto-transcribed subtitles have almost no punctuation",
  "讯飞": "iFlytek",
  "讯飞开放平台“录音文件转写”：整个文件上传到讯飞，转写完成后取回带时间的句子。需要在讯飞控制台开通该服务并拿到 AppID 和 SecretKey。": "iFlytek Open Platform “audio file transcription”: the whole file is uploaded to iFlytek, and sentences with timestamps are fetched after transcription. You need to enable the service in the iFlytek console and get an AppID and SecretKey.",
  "语义断句": "Semantic splitting",
  "语音翻译": "Voice translation",
  "语音识别": "Speech recognition",
  "语音转文字的结果也做预处理": "Also preprocess speech-to-text results",
  "请确认": "Please confirm",
  "豆包语音“大模型录音文件极速版识别”：整段上传、接近说话速度出结果，中文很准。音频会先在本机转成 16 kHz 单声道 WAV，每 10 分钟一段上传到火山引擎。需要在火山引擎控制台开通该资源。": "Doubao Speech “large-model audio file fast recognition”: the whole file is uploaded and results come back at about speaking speed, very accurate for Chinese. The audio is first converted on this computer to 16 kHz mono WAV and uploaded to Volcano Engine in 10-minute pieces. You need to enable this resource in the Volcano Engine console.",
  "送给 AI 前去掉口水词": "Remove filler words before sending to AI",
  "送给 AI 前去掉非语音说明": "Remove non-speech notes before sending to AI",
  "选择 VAD 模型文件": "Choose VAD model file",
  "逐词时间": "Word-level timestamps",
  "长（只看文稿）": "Long (transcript only)",
  "预处理后自动补标点": "Add punctuation automatically after preprocessing",
  "高级：手动指定程序 / 模型文件（Whisper）": "Advanced: specify the program / model file manually (Whisper)",
  "默认关：口水词统一交给“字幕预处理”。打开后识别结果里讯飞标成顺滑词的字直接不要": "Off by default: filler words are all handled by “Subtitle preprocessing”. When on, characters iFlytek marks as smoothing words are dropped from the result",
  "默认关：口水词统一交给“字幕预处理”，几种引擎行为一致。打开后由火山在识别时就去掉": "Off by default: filler words are all handled by “Subtitle preprocessing”, so all engines behave the same. When on, Volcano removes them during recognition",
