  "传输记录": "Transfer history",
  "勾选的设备才会收到你发出的文件和文字。浏览器扩展默认不勾：它收到的内容会再交回主程序，造成来回传。": "Only checked devices receive the files and text you send. The browser extension is unchecked by default: what it receives would be handed back to the main program, causing a loop.",
