  "只在局域网内传输，不经过任何服务器": "Transferred only within the local network, never through any server",
  "只读：这里显示手机之间的对话，不会发给手机。": "Read-only: this shows conversations between phones and is not sent to phones.",
  "在左侧“发送对象”里勾选": "Check one under “Send to” on the left",
  "复制网址": "Copy URL",
  "已发送，手机网页的“电脑发来的”里可以下载{0}": "Sent; download it under “From the computer” on the phone web page{0}",
  "开启后，已配对的手机能在网页里互相发文字，不用经过你操作。消息只在局域网内流转，但要经过这台电脑上的清影转发，所以你在这里能看到全部内容。关闭或退出清影后记录清空。": "When on, paired phones can send text to each other in the web page without any action from you. Messages stay within the local network but are relayed by ClearClip on this computer, so you can see everything here. The record is cleared when you turn this off or quit ClearClip.",
  "开启后，手机扫码就能把链接、文字、照片、视频和文件发到电脑，也能下载电脑发给手机的内容。": "When on, phones can scan the code to send links, text, photos, videos and files to the computer, and download what the computer sends to the phone.",
