  "支持 PDF、Word、PPT、Excel、EPUB、TXT、Markdown、SRT / VTT / ASS 字幕，以及 PNG / JPG / WebP 图片。": "Supports PDF, Word, PPT, Excel, EPUB, TXT, Markdown, SRT / VTT / ASS subtitles, and PNG / JPG / WebP images.",
  "文档、电子书、字幕": "Documents, e-books, subtitles",
  "每页原文后面跟一页译文": "Each original page is followed by a translated page",
  "没装组件时 PDF 只输出 TXT。文字版 PDF 把译文放回原来的位置（放不下会缩小字号，最小 6 磅）；扫描版和图片先交给视觉模型识字并给出位置（需要支持看图的模型，一次最多 60 页）。公式、竖排、重叠的文字可能错位，输出后请抽查。": "Without the component, PDFs only output TXT. Text PDFs get the translation placed back in the original position (the font shrinks if it doesn't fit, minimum 6 pt); scanned PDFs and images are first read by the vision model, which also gives positions (needs a model that supports images, up to 60 pages at a time). Formulas, vertical text and overlapping text may be misplaced; spot-check the output.",
  "清掉并重翻": "Clear and re-translate",
  "用 Windows 10/11 自带的识字，不用下载、不上传页面；识别的语言取决于系统里装了哪些语言包（“屏幕翻译 → 识字”里可以选）。小字会先放大再识别。": "Uses the Windows 10/11 built-in OCR: no download and pages aren't uploaded; the recognized languages depend on which language packs are installed (you can pick under “Screen translation → OCR”). Small text is enlarged before recognition.",
