  "在任何程序里选中文字后按它，弹出写作窗。例如 Ctrl+Alt+J，留空表示不启用。网页里也可以用浏览器扩展的浮标。": "Press it after selecting text in any program to open the writing window. For example Ctrl+Alt+J; leave empty to disable. In web pages you can also use the browser extension's floating button.",
