  "正在分析…": "Analyzing…",
  "每行一个进程名，如 code.exe。密码框、全屏程序、清影自己的窗口始终不出现。": "One process name per line, e.g. code.exe. Password fields, fullscreen programs and ClearClip's own windows never show it.",
  "清空全部记忆": "Clear all memory",
  "点进输入框时出现小浮标": "Show a small badge when you click into an input box",
  "立即恢复": "Resume now",
  "粘贴 1 到 3 段你自己写过的文字（聊天、邮件、帖子都行），模型总结出你的写作习惯。文字只发给你选的模型，不保存。": "Paste 1 to 3 pieces of your own writing (chats, emails or posts all work), and the model summarizes your writing habits. The text is only sent to the model you chose and is not saved.",
  "粘贴你自己写的文字": "Paste your own writing",
  "让清影学你的风格": "Let ClearClip learn your style",
  "记下的写法（{0}）": "Remembered phrasing ({0})",
  "身份、常用称呼、落款、偏好。例如：我叫小林，产品经理；给客户用“您”；落款写“小林”。": "Identity, usual forms of address, sign-off, preferences. For example: I'm Lin, a product manager; use “您” for clients; sign off as “小林”.",
  "还没有。你在写作窗里点“替换原文”或“替换到…”后，这次写回去的文字会记在这里。": "Nothing yet. After you click “Replace original” or “Replace with…” in the writing window, the text written back is remembered here.",
  "默认关闭。开了以后：记住你写回过的写法（最多 12 条），再加上下面“关于我”的笔记，每次一起交给你选的模型，让它更像你写的。记忆只存在本机，关掉后不再使用，可以随时清空。": "Off by default. When on: it remembers phrasing you wrote back (up to 12), adds the notes in “About me” below, and passes them to the model you chose each time so it sounds more like you. The memory is stored only on this computer, isn't used once turned off, and can be cleared any time.",
  "默认本地模型优先，没有再用云端 API。": "By default the local model is used first, then the cloud API if there is none.",
