  "{0}（我的）": "{0} (mine)",
  "· 网站：{0}{1}": "· Sites: {0}{1}",
  "“专家”是一套翻译策略（提示词）：针对某个领域规定用词、语气和格式处理。默认的【通用】适合大多数场景；翻译字幕、网页时会按这里选的专家翻译。 开了“按网站自动选用”，默认专家是【通用】时会按网址换成匹配的专家（例如 github.com → 技术文档）。可以自己写，也可以从沉浸式翻译公开的": "An “expert” is a translation strategy (prompt): it sets wording, tone and formatting for a field. The default [General] suits most cases; when translating subtitles and web pages, the expert chosen here is used. With “Pick by website automatically” on, when the default expert is [General], it switches to the matching expert by URL (for example github.com → Technical docs). You can write your own, or install from the public library of Immersive Translate",
  "一句话说明": "One-line description",
  "专家文件": "Expert file",
  "使用中": "In use",
  "例如：Translate legal contracts formally. Keep defined terms consistent…": "e.g. Translate legal contracts formally. Keep defined terms consistent…",
