  "来自沉浸式翻译公开仓库，按需安装，不随程序分发；安装后可在“我的专家”里使用和修改生效网站。": "From the public Immersive Translate library, installed on demand and not shipped with the program; after installing you can use it and edit its sites under “My experts”.",
