  "字幕作为独立轨道放进视频，播放器里可以切换；MP4 / MKV / WebM 可用，速度很快。": "Subtitles are added to the video as a separate track and can be switched in the player; available for MP4 / MKV / WebM, very fast.",
  "字幕变成画面的一部分，任何播放器都能看到；需要重新编码，较慢。双语字幕第二行可以用不同的字号和颜色。": "Subtitles become part of the picture and show in any player; requires re-encoding, so it is slower. In bilingual subtitles the second line can use a different size and color.",
