  "SRT 总会保存。原字幕轨、译文轨、双语轨各是一个文件（如 视频.zh.srt、视频.zh.双语.srt）。云端识别和翻译会把内容发给你配置的服务。": "SRT is always saved. The original track, translation track and bilingual track are each a file (e.g. video.zh.srt, video.zh.bilingual.srt). Cloud recognition and translation send content to the service you configured.",
