  "已开始生成字幕，进度在下方；完成后字幕会保存在视频旁边并登记到媒体库。": "Started generating subtitles; progress is below. When finished the subtitles are saved next to the video and added to the library.",
  "已开始纠错，完成后生成“已修正”的新字幕，原字幕不会被修改，改动明细保存在 .改动.json 里。": "Started correcting; when finished a new “corrected” subtitle is generated, the original subtitle isn't modified, and the change details are saved in .改动.json.",
  "拆开的字幕对到真实的词间停顿（仅本机 whisper.cpp）": "Align split subtitles to real pauses between words (on-device whisper.cpp only)",
