  "自动（识别结果没有标点时才用 AI）": "Auto (use AI only when the recognition result has no punctuation)",
  "让 AI 在语义停顿处断开（不改一个字，不行就退回规则）": "Let AI break at semantic pauses (without changing a character; falls back to rules if it can't)",
  "识别说话内容 → 去掉误识别 → 补标点、改错字 → 断句 → 可选翻译成双语，保存在视频旁边并登记到媒体库、加入字幕搜索。": "Recognize speech → remove misrecognitions → add punctuation and fix typos → split sentences → optionally translate into bilingual; saved next to the video, added to the library and to subtitle search.",
  "译完再让 AI 对照原文检查润色（更准，请求量约翻倍）": "After translating, have AI check and polish against the original (more accurate, about twice the requests)",
  "过长的字幕按标点自动拆开": "Split overly long subtitles by punctuation automatically",
  "还没有配置对话模型，只能用“只用规则”": "No chat model is configured yet; only “Rules only” can be used",
  "适合没有标点的自动字幕（语音识别、YouTube 自动字幕、B 站 AI 字幕）。每一行的改动都会被检查：改得太多、改了数字、动了术语库里的词，都会被拒绝并保留原文；时间不会变。结果存成新文件，原字幕不动。": "Suitable for auto-generated subtitles without punctuation (speech recognition, YouTube auto subtitles, Bilibili AI subtitles). Every line's changes are checked: changing too much, changing numbers or touching words in the glossary is rejected and the original is kept; timing doesn't change. The result is saved as a new file and the original subtitle is untouched.",
