  "备份包含媒体库记录、标签、评分、订阅、直播间、解析历史、收到的链接、设置，以及生词本（含复习记录和原声）、术语库、AI 专家、摘录、翻译记忆；不包含下载的文件本身、各种缓存，也不包含登录 Cookie、API 密钥和手机配对令牌（换电脑后需要重新登录、重新填密钥、重新配对）。": "A backup includes library records, tags, ratings, subscriptions, live rooms, parse history, received links, settings, plus the vocabulary book (with review records and original audio), glossaries, AI experts, excerpts and translation memory; it doesn't include the downloaded files themselves, caches, login cookies, API keys or phone pairing tokens (on a new computer you need to log in, enter keys and pair again).",
  "已保存，扩展下次同步时生效": "Saved; takes effect at the extension's next sync",
  "扩展里的笔记、高亮和导入的字幕改动后会同步一份到清影（随备份一起保存；新装扩展或刚连上清影时自动取回）。超过上限的那次不同步，扩展里的数据不受影响。": "Notes, highlights and imported subtitles in the extension are synced to ClearClip after changes (saved with backups; retrieved automatically when you install the extension or it first connects to ClearClip). A sync that exceeds the limit is skipped, and the data in the extension is unaffected.",
